Extra Hard Mode (Fabric 26.2 port)
==================================

This project is a greenfield Fabric reimplementation of Extra Hard Mode
for Minecraft Java 26.2. It is licensed under GNU AGPL v3.0 or later
(SPDX: AGPL-3.0-or-later).

It is not a copy of the original `com.extrahardmode.*` Java sources.

